# Corelamo — Roadmap

## Reliability & Correctness
- [ ] **Tests** — unit + integration coverage across handlers, storage, and index
- [ ] **Replace `unwrap()` calls** — no panics on the request path; propagate errors properly
- [ ] **Proper error responses** — stop collapsing everything into `CorelamoError::Internal`; map each failure to the right variant/status
- [ ] **Request validation** — body size limits, field whitelisting, reject malformed input early

## Observability
- [ ] **Structured logging** — replace `println!` with `tracing`; capture latency, error rates, request counts
- [ ] **Health & status checks** — richer `/status`, liveness/readiness endpoints
- [ ] **Reindex progress** — return "started" immediately, expose progress; don't block the whole time

## Search Features
- [ ] **Pagination** — `limit` + `offset` on search
- [ ] **Field-specific search / filters** — numeric search, per-field queries
- [ ] **Offset support** — tie into pagination

## Data Management
- [ ] **Backup / restore** — full database snapshot + recovery
- [ ] **Update/delete partial replace** — merge semantics, not full-document overwrite
- [ ] **Database configuration persistence** — persist `DatabaseOptions` across restarts
- [ ] **Config via API** — `GET`/`PUT /db/{name}/config` for `DatabaseOptions`

## Performance
- [ ] **Optimize HTTP → database path** — connection handling, reduce conversion overhead

## Security & Access
- [ ] **Rate limiting**
- [ ] **HTTPS**

## Distributed
- [ ] **Clustering** :D

